{"id":"e1bfc8cc22293797","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-jump-process.md","title":"Jump Process","display":"df-jump-process — Jump Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jump-process","aliases":["58-df-jump-process","Jump Process"],"display":"df-jump-process — Jump Process","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-jump.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jump-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jump-process</span><span>Jump Process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump-process — Jump Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e1e039b5b31a7f6\" href=\"?note=7e1e039b5b31a7f6\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-jump.md\">../batch14/58-df-jump.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E\\in V\">\\(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\\)</span> (stochastic-process predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S\\)</span> (jump-size predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e1e039b5b31a7f6\" href=\"?note=7e1e039b5b31a7f6\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-jump.md\">../batch14/58-df-jump.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JumpProcess}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{JumpProcess}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (jump-process predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{JumpProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\exists t&gt;0\\;\\exists\\Delta\\in E\\;(\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\Delta,X(\\cdot)(\\omega),t)\\land\\Delta\\neq0)\\}\\bigr)&gt;0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{JumpProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\exists t&gt;0\\;\\exists\\Delta\\in E\\;(\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\Delta,X(\\cdot)(\\omega),t)\\land\\Delta\\neq0)\\}\\bigr)&gt;0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here a jump process means a stochastic process whose sample path has a nonzero jump with positive probability; a pure-jump process additionally has no continuous component.</li>\n<li>Pure-jump, compound Poisson, and Levy decompositions are specialized subclasses or representation theorems.</li>\n<li>Compound Poisson: sum of i.i.d. jumps at Poisson times; infinitely divisible</li>\n<li>Hawkes: self-exciting jumps; intensity depends on past jumps; used in finance</li>\n<li>Piecewise deterministic: deterministic between jumps; models queues, insurance</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cont and Tankov, Financial Modelling with Jump Processes</li>\n<li>Applebaum, Lévy Processes and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-jump.md","status":"resolved","id":"7e1e039b5b31a7f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-jump.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StochProc}_S$ (stochastic-process predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-jump.md","status":"resolved","id":"7e1e039b5b31a7f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S$ (jump-size predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-jump.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JumpProcess}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{JumpProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\\exists t>0\\;\\exists\\Delta\\in E\\;(\\mathrm{JumpSize}_S(\\Delta,X(\\cdot)(\\omega),t)\\land\\Delta\\neq0)\\}\\bigr)>0","display":true}],"bytes":1752,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-726","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-jump-process.md|58-df-jump-process]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["b5f77bed7dfe3f07","7e1e039b5b31a7f6","0578a357a86e9d8f"]}